# Keep the worker image lean: exclude git history, other clouds, testing, and
# the two heavy re-fetchable/log-only trees. k8s scope/deployment/diagnose work
# without them; add them back (or `terraform init` at runtime) for log:read /
# terraform-provisioned scopes.
.git
.github
testing
azure
azure-aro
datadog
scheduled_task
k8s/log/kube-logger-go
k8s/terraform/.terraform
**/.terraform
worker/node_modules
worker/dist
Dockerfile.worker
*.md
